OL,3,AWatch: Moment Esther Rantzen reunites
OL,4,Aman with children he saved from Nazi
OL,5,Aoccupation
OL,6,
OL,7,FDame Esther had been told the story of
OL,8,FNicholas Winton, the man who had
OL,9,Forganised the rescue of 669 children
OL,10,Ffrom Czechoslovakia, which was occupied
OL,11,Fin 1939 by Nazi forces.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
