OL,3,AKanye West's Russia shows officially
OL,4,Acancelled after weeks of uncertainty
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo of Ye's gigs in Russia have been
OL,7,Fofficially cancelled, organisers have
OL,8,Fconfirmed.
OL,10,FThe rapper, formerly known as Kanye
OL,11,FWest, had been due to perform at the
OL,12,FGazprom Arena in St Petersburg on 10
OL,13,Fand 11 October.
OL,15,FBut there was confusion in the lead-up
OL,16,Fto the shows, as the venue had said it
OL,17,Fwouldn't host him for what would have
OL,18,Fbeen the biggest show by a western
OL,19,Fartist since Russia invaded Ukraine in
OL,20,F2022.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
